  "slug": "tally-replace-windows-connector-pc",
  "title": "Moving the Syncora Connector to Another Windows PC",
  "description": "Prepare the new accounting PC and validate the first sync there with a small set of TallyPrime records.",
  "category": "Setup",
  "sections": [
    {
      "heading": "Capture the working setup",
      "body": "On the old PC, note the Syncora account, the exact TallyPrime company name and the most recent successful sync. Keep two sample vouchers available for comparison. Ask whoever manages TallyPrime to confirm that the intended company can be opened on the replacement PC."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Switch one PC at a time",
      "body": "Finish any work in the old connector before stopping it. Install the current connector from the official Syncora setup guide on the new PC, sign in to the intended account and select the correct company. If a second company with a similar name appears, pause and compare with the original setup before proceeding."
    },
    {
      "heading": "Verify the move with real records",
      "body": "After the new PC reports a successful sync, check the sample vouchers in Syncora using the same dates, types and numbers. Retain the old setup details until those checks pass. If the company mapping is unclear, ask support to review the two company names and the connector logs."
    }
  ],
